%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 500ef08f4cfac4121a17369cfd788261, type: 3}
  m_Name: TutorialScene3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: 'This is the main interface. Let me explain to you each element that you
      will see in the interface. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 0, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: 'The exercises that you perform, Atlas, will control every aspect of your
      Titan. It''s not just about strength, but flexibility, stamina, and coordination. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
    actions: []
  - text: So, it's a full-body challenge?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: -632, y: -132}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 557, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: "Yes, Atlas. And as you progress, your Titan's abilities will mirror your
      growth. It\u2019s best that you get a feel for it yourself."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 557, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: -632, y: -132}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: "I\u2019ll start the simulation mode, and try to see and feel what it\u2019s
      like to sync with your mech."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
    actions: []
  - text: (Atlas in the pilot)
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 3
      coords: {x: -632, y: -132}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 3
      coords: {x: 557, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: Good job, Atlas! Remember, each exercise has its purpose. A squat can power
      a Titan's legs for a strong kick, a push-up charges your Titan's arm strength
      for a powerful punch.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: -632, y: -132}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 557, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: I understand, Luna. So, my fitness directly influences my Titan?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: -632, y: -132}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 557, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: That's right. Now, as we progress these things will become even more difficult.
      But for now, practice these exercises. It's the first step to becoming a Titan
      Handler.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: -632, y: -132}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 557, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: I'm on it, Luna.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: -632, y: -132}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 557, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: 'Here''s to becoming the best Titan Handler Neo-Terra has ever seen. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
    actions: []
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5310aed3d7f83b542af0c908ab863a8c, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8e6ba4eca1138488e84d4caaf1fe51ae, type: 2}
